<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Quit</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>quit
</pre>
<p>Makes you leave the game. Your character is saved as you go, with everything 
you carry and wear, and you come back to it the next time you log on. You must 
type the whole word: quit, no less, so that you don't leave by accident.
</p><p>You can't quit while you are fighting: flee first. And for ten minutes after a 
fight with another player, you can't quit either; the game tells you how long 
you have left to wait.
</p><p>If your character has never been saved, you are still a guest, and a guest is 
forgotten when they quit. See <a cmd='#'>Help Save</a>.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Save</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Fleeing</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Equipment</a>
</pre>




</div>